    "successor_ticker": null,
    "summary": "2023年5月15日，BP Products North America Inc.（BP p.l.c.子公司）完成對TravelCenters of America Inc.（Nasdaq: TA）之1.3億美元收購案；新聞稿明確載明「Today...completed its $1.3 billion acquisition of TravelCenters of America Inc. (Nasdaq: TA)」，並確認「TravelCenters of America common shares have been converted into the right to receive $86 per share」，顯示TA普通股已因收購完成而轉換為現金對價、終止以原身分於Nasdaq掛牌交易。收購案於2月由BP宣布，但新聞稿未載明確切公告日期，故公告日期欄位留空。此為現金併購，無後續證券代號延續。",
    "timing": "completed",
    "unresolved_conditions": [
      "新聞稿僅提及BP於「2月」宣布收購協議，未載明確切公告日期"
    ],
    "venue": "NASDAQ",
