      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T17:02:01.611865+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-1",
      "start_char": 8756,
      "text": "HOUSTON, May 15, 2023 /PRNewswire/ -- Today BP Products North America Inc., a wholly owned indirect subsidiary of BP p.l.c. (NYSE: bp), completed its $1.3 billion acquisition of TravelCenters of America Inc. (Nasdaq: TA), one of the country's leading full-service travel center operators, marking a milestone for the US in the growth of bp's strategic convenience and mobility business and welcoming thousands of additional employees into bp.",
      "text_sha256": "499f54068c0e85a639312ae025272a4ccd8b539d95bfe540031abba853ab6358",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bp-expands-mobility-and-convenience-network-completing-the-purchase-of-leading-travel-center-operator-travelcenters-of-america-301824610.html"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 11020,
      "passage_id": "source-1:p452",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "www.prnewswire.com",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T17:02:01.611865+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-1",
      "start_char": 10886,
      "text": "With the close of the acquisition, TravelCenters of America common shares have been converted into the right to receive $86 per share.",
      "text_sha256": "79d2c4cafd60d6b800a96c5cfb13ed650fb19c1b2467bbb7273ebc23f4a02480",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bp-expands-mobility-and-convenience-network-completing-the-purchase-of-leading-travel-center-operator-travelcenters-of-america-301824610.html"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 10323,
      "passage_id": "source-1:p445",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "www.prnewswire.com",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T17:02:01.611865+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-1",
      "start_char": 9942,
      "text": "In February, bp announced it had agreed to acquire TA, subject to required approvals. Having received those approvals and with the transaction complete, TA's strategically located network of highway sites complements bp's existing predominantly off-highway convenience and mobility business in the US, enabling TA and bp to offer fleets and consumers a seamless nationwide service.",
      "text_sha256": "2fc2c4a2018d47ca114fc8eb141714e1868a798ed7b8968fd2aca3d1b6616e54",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bp-expands-mobility-and-convenience-network-completing-the-purchase-of-leading-travel-center-operator-travelcenters-of-america-301824610.html"
    }
  ],
